                <p>Source: Department of State, Presidential Correspondence: Lot 66 D 204. No
                    classification marking. Drafted by Hartley (S/S-RO) on May 7 and cleared by Davis, Farley (S/AE), and McCloskey (P).
                    The source text, titled “Suggested Reply,” is double spaced.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d14-f2" n="1" xml:id="d14-f2-content">
